<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"></head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #3D3935; margin:0; padding:24px; background-color:#F4F8F3;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:640px; background-color:#FFFFFF;">
<tr>
  <td style="background-color:#004D36; padding:16px 20px;">
    <h2 style="color:#FFFFFF; margin:0; font-size:18px;">Insight Notifier — {{ reason }}</h2>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="padding:18px 20px 22px;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">The weekly OEE Insight email run encountered a problem and <strong style="color:#8A5A00;">did not send manager emails</strong>.</p>
    <pre style="background:#F4F8F3; border-left:3px solid #E0A800; padding:12px; font-size:12px; overflow-x:auto; white-space:pre-wrap;">{{ details }}</pre>
    <p style="margin:14px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#6B6560;">Please check the Qlik reload schedule and the notifier logs.</p>
  </td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
